# Lockfiles are not tracked: every crate here is published, and a library's
# lockfile is ignored by its consumers anyway. Dependency floors are expressed
# as carets in Cargo.toml instead, so a consumer resolves the newest compatible
# version rather than whatever this repository happened to build against.
Cargo.lock
